### SOFTWARE & AI DEVELOPER


eloict:SoftwareAIDeveloper a eloict:Specialisation ;
    eloict:partOfTrack eloict:ICTTrack ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:DotNETAdvanced ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:DataScience ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:AppliedProgramming ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:AIProgramming ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:DotNETProgramming ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:AlgoData .


### WEB & MOBILE DEVELOPER


eloict:WebDeveloper a eloict:Specialisation ;
    eloict:partOfTrack eloict:ICTTrack ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:JavascriptDevelopment ;
    eloict:hasMandatoryCourse eloict:BackendDevelopment ;
